<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Dev Nayak Fitness</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background: #111;
      color: white;
    }

    header {
      background: #000;
      padding: 20px 8%;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
    }

    .logo {
      color: #ff3c00;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 25px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: #ff3c00;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 90vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 50px 8%;
      background: linear-gradient(
        rgba(0,0,0,.65),
        rgba(0,0,0,.65)
      ),
      linear-gradient(135deg, #292929, #111);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: 60px;
      max-width: 700px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: #ff3c00;
    }

    .hero p {
      margin: 20px 0;
      font-size: 20px;
      color: #ccc;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #ff3c00;
      color: white;
      padding: 14px 30px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    section {
      padding: 70px 8%;
      text-align: center;
    }

    section h2 {
      font-size: 38px;
      margin-bottom: 35px;
      color: #ff3c00;
    }

    .cards {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 25px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .card {
      background: #222;
      padding: 30px;
      width: 280px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(255,60,0,.2);
    }

    .card h3 {
      color: #ff3c00;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .card p {
      color: #ccc;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .contact {
      background: #181818;
    }

    footer {
      background: #000;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      color: #aaa;
    }

    @media(max-width: 700px) {
      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      header {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 15px;
      }

      nav a {
        margin: 8px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <div class="logo">DEV NAYAK</div>

    <nav>
      <a href="#home">Home</a>
      <a href="#workout">Workout</a>
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div>
      <h1>BUILD YOUR <span>BODY</span><br>BUILD YOUR LIFE</h1>

      <p>
        Welcome to Dev Nayak Fitness — Train Hard, Stay Strong.
      </p>

      <a href="#workout" class="btn">START WORKOUT</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="workout">
    <h2>My Fitness Programs</h2>

    <div class="cards">

      <div class="card">
        <h3>💪 Muscle Gain</h3>
        <p>
          Strength training aur muscle building ke liye
          effective workout routine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🔥 Fat Loss</h3>
        <p>
          Cardio aur workout ke through healthy fat-loss
          routine follow karein.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <h3>🏋️ Strength</h3>
        <p>
          Body strength aur stamina improve karne ke
          liye powerful exercises.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <h2>About Dev Nayak</h2>

    <p>
      Main Dev Nayak hoon. Fitness meri passion hai.
      Mera goal logon ko healthy, strong aur active
      lifestyle ke liye motivate karna hai.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2>Contact Me</h2>

    <p>Email: devnayak@example.com</p>
    <br>

    <a href="mailto:devnayak@example.com" class="btn">
      CONTACT NOW
    </a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    © 2026 Dev Nayak Fitness | All Rights Reserved
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
